User uploads PDF/DOCX/TXT
    ↓
POST /documents/upload (documents.py)
    ↓
Save file to uploads/ folder
    ↓
Call ingest() function (ingestion.py)
    ↓
Load file → Split into chunks → Add metadata → Store in Chroma
    ↓
Return {doc_id, chunk_count} to user
    ↓
Vector DB persisted to ./chroma_db/